Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The molten wallpaper's GLSL (src/draw/lp_molten.c, ported from
../web/src/lib/moltenShader.ts) is derived from a shader by Mårten Rånge,
published on Shadertoy. Its licence has not been established: Shadertoy's
default terms are CC BY-NC-SA 3.0, which is not compatible with the Apache
License 2.0. This needs to be resolved before the shader is distributed under
this LICENSE — by confirming the author's terms, obtaining permission, or
replacing the field. See docs/design-direction.md in the repository root.

The library links Cairo, Pango, fontconfig, pixman and libxkbcommon, and
optionally wlroots, Wayland, EGL and OpenGL ES; it does not include them. Each
carries its own licence.
